title: MunnaBhai_Day4a
tags:
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite MunnaTyreShop>>

// Day 4 - Path A: Learning Basic Repair Techniques
Ready to put yesterday's commitments into practice, Raju arrives early before the day's repair demands test his abilities.

The morning calm provides ideal conditions for beginning his chosen role. Munna Bhai's evaluation today will determine whether his assistance becomes meaningful contribution or impractical interest.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Smiling">>
MunnaBhai: Ah, you're early! Good sign, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Quizzical">>
MunnaBhai: Ready for your first real day of mechanical work?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Completely ready, bhai!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I've been thinking about this all night.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Serious">>
MunnaBhai: First, let me show you how to properly clean and organize tools.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Quizzical">>
MunnaBhai: It might seem simple, but do you know why tool maintenance matters?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: To keep them working properly?

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Serious">>
MunnaBhai: More than that. Clean tools give better grip, prevent slipping.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Serious">>
MunnaBhai: Organized tools save time when customers are waiting.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Worried">>
MunnaBhai: And proper storage prevents rust that ruins precision.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Astonished">>
Raju: I see! Every detail affects the quality of work.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Smiling">>
MunnaBhai: Exactly! Now watch how I inspect this tire lever.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Serious">>
MunnaBhai: See any nicks or bends? Those can puncture tubes during removal.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: So even the tools must be perfect to avoid damaging repairs?

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Proud">>
MunnaBhai: Now you're understanding mechanical work, beta!

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Serious">>
MunnaBhai: Everything connects. Tool quality affects repair quality affects customer safety.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Astonished">>
Raju: This is more complex than I imagined, bhai!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: But I love seeing how everything matters.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Smiling">>
MunnaBhai: Good! Your attitude shows real promise.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Skeptical">>
MunnaBhai: Now let's see if your performance matches your enthusiasm.

<<HideCharacter>>
As the morning session intensifies with tool care and preparation work, both understand the next hours will prove whether his assistance represents genuine value or well-meaning interference. The hands-on work tests not only technical abilities but capacity to maintain quality under pressure.

<<set $MunnaBhai_Day = 5>>
<<EndEvent true>>
===

