// Day 4 - Path B: Customer Service Focus
Ready to put yesterday's commitments into practice, Raju arrives early before the day's repair demands test his abilities.

The morning calm provides ideal conditions for beginning his chosen role. Munna Bhai's evaluation today will determine whether his assistance becomes meaningful contribution or impractical interest.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Smiling">>
MunnaBhai: Ah, you're early! Good sign, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Quizzical">>
MunnaBhai: Ready to face demanding customers?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: Completely ready, bhai!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I've been thinking about how to help customers understand quality work.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Serious">>
MunnaBhai: Let me give you some important guidance first.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Quizzical">>
MunnaBhai: What do you think customers want most?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: Quick repairs?

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Serious">>
MunnaBhai: They say quick. But what they really need is reliable.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Worried">>
MunnaBhai: A quick patch that fails tomorrow creates bigger problems.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Confident">>
MunnaBhai: A proper repair that takes extra time saves them money and trouble.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Astonished">>
Raju: So my job is helping them see the difference?

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Smiling">>
MunnaBhai: Exactly! Help them understand value, not just cost.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Quizzical">>
MunnaBhai: Some customers get impatient. How would you handle that?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: Stay calm and explain why quality takes time?

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Smiling">>
MunnaBhai: Good start. But also show empathy.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Serious">>
MunnaBhai: Their bicycle might be their livelihood. Acknowledge that urgency.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Confident">>
MunnaBhai: Then explain how proper work protects that livelihood better.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I understand! Balance empathy with education.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Proud">>
MunnaBhai: You learn quickly, beta! Let's see how you do with real customers.

<<HideCharacter>>
As the morning session prepares Raju for customer interactions, both understand the next hours will prove whether his assistance represents genuine value or well-meaning interference. The customer service role tests communication skills and capacity to represent quality under pressure.

