title: MunnaBhai_Day5
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite MunnaTyreShop>>

// Day 5 - Building on success
After successfully completing his first full day, Raju returns eager to build on yesterday's experience and continue proving his value.

The familiar sights and sounds greet Raju with growing confidence. Yesterday's successful navigation of workshop pressure validated both his capabilities and Munna Bhai's trust. The second day carries different energy as both move beyond experimental assistance into genuine skill transfer partnership.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MunnaBhai" "Astonished">>
